        "id": "E1",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Microsoft to expand Azure Maia system to multi-gigawatt deployments - The Official Microsoft Blog",
        "sourceUrl": "https://blogs.microsoft.com/blog/2026/10/12/microsoft-to-expand-azure-maia-system-to-multi-gigawatt-deployments/",
        "source": "Microsoft (Official Blog)",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-12T13:01:29.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-15T09:10:19.120Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E2",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Azure Maia 200 now in production; Azure Maia 300 coming in 2027",
        "sourceUrl": "https://blogs.microsoft.com/blog/2026/10/12/microsoft-to-expand-azure-maia-system-to-multi-gigawatt-deployments/",
        "source": "Microsoft (Official Blog)",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-12T13:01:29.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-15T09:10:19.120Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E3",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "We will scale our Azure Maia family to multi-gigawatt deployments starting in 2027, making Maia the primary inference system for Microsoft products and services.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://blogs.microsoft.com/blog/2026/10/12/microsoft-to-expand-azure-maia-system-to-multi-gigawatt-deployments/",
        "source": "Microsoft (Official Blog)",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-12T13:01:29.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-15T09:10:19.120Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E4",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Maia 200 is now serving Microsoft production workloads, including Microsoft Copilot , and supporting the MAI team as they develop next-generation models, with GitHub Copilot and Microsoft Foundry to follow by end of year.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://blogs.microsoft.com/blog/2026/10/12/microsoft-to-expand-azure-maia-system-to-multi-gigawatt-deployments/",
        "source": "Microsoft (Official Blog)",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-12T13:01:29.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-15T09:10:19.120Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E5",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Across these workloads, Maia 200 runs OpenAI models , Microsoft’s own MAI models and leading open-source model families.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://blogs.microsoft.com/blog/2026/10/12/microsoft-to-expand-azure-maia-system-to-multi-gigawatt-deployments/",
        "source": "Microsoft (Official Blog)",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-12T13:01:29.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-15T09:10:19.120Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E6",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Maia 300 is a complete intelligent system designed for the new types of AI workloads emerging today: Long-context reasoning, latency-sensitive conversational experiences and sustained, multi-step agentic tasks.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://blogs.microsoft.com/blog/2026/10/12/microsoft-to-expand-azure-maia-system-to-multi-gigawatt-deployments/",
        "source": "Microsoft (Official Blog)",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-12T13:01:29.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-15T09:10:19.120Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E7",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "By improving efficiency across the system, we expect Maia 300 to deliver 40% more tokens per megawatt compared to leading GPU-based systems.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://blogs.microsoft.com/blog/2026/10/12/microsoft-to-expand-azure-maia-system-to-multi-gigawatt-deployments/",
        "source": "Microsoft (Official Blog)",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-12T13:01:29.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-15T09:10:19.120Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E8",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Maia 200: Driving the workloads that Microsoft runs at scale",
        "sourceUrl": "https://blogs.microsoft.com/blog/2026/10/12/microsoft-to-expand-azure-maia-system-to-multi-gigawatt-deployments/",
        "source": "Microsoft (Official Blog)",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-12T13:01:29.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-15T09:10:19.120Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E9",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "The Azure Maia system is designed around the real-world workloads Microsoft runs at scale and the models we expect to build in the years ahead.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://blogs.microsoft.com/blog/2026/10/12/microsoft-to-expand-azure-maia-system-to-multi-gigawatt-deployments/",
        "source": "Microsoft (Official Blog)",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-12T13:01:29.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-15T09:10:19.120Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E10",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Maia 200 is deploying across the United States, Europe and Australia and delivering up to 1.7x more tokens per watt for built-in AI capabilities in Microsoft Teams, Copilot and Cowork experiences compared with leading GPU infrastructure.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://blogs.microsoft.com/blog/2026/10/12/microsoft-to-expand-azure-maia-system-to-multi-gigawatt-deployments/",
        "source": "Microsoft (Official Blog)",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-12T13:01:29.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-15T09:10:19.120Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E11",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Experience running our AI models and services on Maia 200 directly informed the design of Maia 300.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://blogs.microsoft.com/blog/2026/10/12/microsoft-to-expand-azure-maia-system-to-multi-gigawatt-deployments/",
        "source": "Microsoft (Official Blog)",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-12T13:01:29.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-15T09:10:19.120Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E12",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "As the third generation of our Azure Maia program, Maia 300 is designed with an inference-first architecture optimized for long-context, memory-intensive and decode-heavy AI workloads.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://blogs.microsoft.com/blog/2026/10/12/microsoft-to-expand-azure-maia-system-to-multi-gigawatt-deployments/",
        "source": "Microsoft (Official Blog)",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-12T13:01:29.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-15T09:10:19.120Z"
      }
